id: reduce-sdk-transport
title: Certify native producer cursor integration for compound envelopes
description: "Pinned public ExtensionCommandReadOutput declares only row_keys. Built-in PmReadOutputProducerContinuation applies to native after-style read results; a binding for this compound extension envelope is not declared there. Packed consumers reject this package cursor through native --output-cursor with read_output_cursor_invalid, while package --cursor and --limit preserve exact counts and proof context. Track future native producer integration; no acceptance criterion is deferred. The packed native and package write-budget guards both pass, so no missing mutation-budget capability is claimed. Public upstream searches found no matching open implementation issue."
type: Feature
status: open
priority: 2
tags[1]: sdk-gap
created_at: "2026-11-06T12:14:18.504Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-06T13:30:31.331Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: A future SDK declares producer continuation and preserves complete mutation receipts through native transport; packed npm and Bun prove it without package fallback flags.
